---Change: Re-run configured native review runners and saved agent reviewers
---
---Re-runs every configured native review runner against the trail's current head and also fires the trail's saved agent reviewers the way a push would, so a stuck agent reviewer recovers alongside any runner reruns. Already active same-head runs and completed reviews are preserved rather than duplicated; only newly accepted runner runs count in the response's Launched. If any runner's run is recorded failed at launch because its prompt is over the 64 KiB launch limit, the response is 422 with the message that run records, even when other runners launched. A launch refused for billing answers 422 with a message saying what to do next, and records no run. A repo whose only reviewers are saved agents answers 202 with Launched: 0; a repo with no reviewer of either kind answers 422.
---
---`POST /api/v1/repos/{repo_id}/changes/{number}/review-rerun`
---@param input entire.trail_reviews.RetryChangeReviewRequest
---@return entire.trail_reviews.ReviewRerunBody? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:retry_change_review(input) end

